# Every text file is LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform: the firmware goes onto boards
# byte for byte, hw_smoke.py recordings replay across checkouts, and the page is served as committed. A Windows clone
# made before this file exists is renormalized with: git add --renormalize . && git commit
* text=auto eol=lf
*.uf2 binary
*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.woff2 binary
